110 0 obj
<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Marcela Kapu is the name of the entity formed by the conscience of a post-graduate scientist on the field of Molecular Biology of the CUC, 25 years-old, who, after a contact event with an anomaly that has the form of a StorePUDisk, 128 GB, USB 1.0 port Fl\
ash Drive, which Marcela initially thought to be a common item acquired online, was copied and transferred to the device, filling up all of its storage, and giving her the ability to project it through communication means with USB support. Through non div\
ulged ways, working together and looking for a way to exploit the new situation, Marcela managed to manifest her original conscience and body in the alleged virtual dimensions, where she found out she could manipulate the world around her in distinct su\
rreal ways, although restricted to those types of reality. Some feats she made include infinite replication, universal transfer \(one of which helped her turn the anomalous Flash Drive into an indestructible object\) and the ability to divide and branch o\
ut her consciences into new variants, one of which would eventually transform into the program known as Guidance_Bob.exe. Currently, the only real world instance of Marcela consists in a video that is stored on a Komichi SP-Y250 model projector, located\
 in the Internal Librarys lost and found section. Due to the consequential absence of any type of register about Marcela on the institution, her existence was quickly discredited, making her a kind of urban legend by its students.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Arial 10 Tf)/DS(font: Arial,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918123615-03'00')/NM(d7acb930cdb148c288da8a71ac95f1c3)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\
l;font-family:Arial;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify">Marcela Kapu is the name of the entity formed by the conscience of a post-graduate scientist on the field of Molecular Biology of the CUC, 25 years-old, who, after a co\
ntact event with an anomaly that has the form of a StorePUDisk, 128 GB, USB 1.0 port Flash Drive, which Marcela initially thought to be a common item acquired online, was copied and transferred to the device, filling up all of its storage, and giving her \
the ability to project it through communication means with USB support. Through non divulged ways, working together and looking for a way to exploit the new situation, Marcela managed to manifest her original conscience and body in the alleged virtual &#8\
220;dimensions&#8221;, where she found out she could manipulate the world around her in distinct surreal ways, although restricted to those types of reality. Some feats she made include infinite replication, universal transfer \(one of which helped her tu\
rn the anomalous Flash Drive into an indestructible object\) and the ability to divide and branch out her consciences into new variants, one of which would eventually transform into the program known as &#8220;Guidance_Bob.exe&#8221;. Currently, the only \
real world instance of Marcela consists in a video that is stored on a Komichi SP-Y250 model projector, located in the Internal Library&#8217;s lost and found section. Due to the consequential absence of any type of register about Marcela on the instituti\
on, her existence was quickly discredited, making her a kind of urban legend by its students.</span></p></body>)/Rect[45.3301 52.864 571.302 206.874]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>
endobj
