<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Biomanipulation - Her passion for Molecular Biology, along with her anomalous conscience have given Kapu the capacity to modify organic composites in her or her allies' favor, by manipulating any type of available organic matter, reconstituting it, alteri\
ng it or mixing it into mechanic systems. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918133759-03'00')/NM(c91dd0727aea4492802a48e2eeb56f21)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\
