<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Self Defense - Aster acquiring the new state of conscience, Kapu realized she was quite lacking in non-anomalous methods for defending herself, so she spent some time learning Martial Arts, gaining a taste for Krav Maga and Tae Kwon Do.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918134255-03'00')/NM(2383cc0cbc544ff083fa42e90841cde2)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\
