<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Academic Knowledge - Before becoming an anomaly, Kapu was a relative higlight of the CUC's student body, with that intelligence being reflected in the different applications of her studies both in a general and specific sense.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918140347-03'00')/NM(b7fd72cf7709488ca17aad559ac010e3)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\
